<%#
  The search trigger in the global header, shown at every width (as an icon only below
  $bp-sidebar). The drawer carries no search of its own.

  It is a plain link to the reference, so it leads somewhere useful without JavaScript;
  search_dialog.js turns a click into opening the search dialog.

  The key it advertises is `/`, the shortcut that actually works.
%>
<a class="search-pill" href="/api" aria-label="Search the documentation">
  <i class="fa fa-search search-pill--icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  <span class="search-pill--label">Search docs…</span>
  <kbd class="search-pill--key">/</kbd>
</a>
